edge-tts --voice "en-US-GuyNeural" --text "The motion and pedometer data is interesting. Health tracking through your agent?" --write-media a15.mp3 && echo "✓ a15"
edge-tts --voice "en-US-GuyNeural" --text "Smart. What about the breaking changes? There were four in the beta release." --write-media a16.mp3 && echo "✓ a16"
edge-tts --voice "en-US-GuyNeural" --text "That's actually a good security move. Most users probably don't need shell access from their chat agent." --write-media a17.mp3 && echo "✓ a17"
edge-tts --voice "en-US-GuyNeural" --text "So the philosophy is restrict dangerous tools but enable orchestration." --write-media a18.mp3 && echo "✓ a18"
edge-tts --voice "en-US-GuyNeural" --text "Plugin authors are going to love that." --write-media a19.mp3 && echo "✓ a19"
edge-tts --voice "en-US-GuyNeural" --text "Let's talk about multimodal memory. Images and audio can be indexed now?" --write-media a20.mp3 && echo "✓ a20"
edge-tts --voice "en-US-GuyNeural" --text "That's the kind of feature that sounds small but changes how you use the whole system." --write-media a21.mp3 && echo "✓ a21"
edge-tts --voice "en-US-GuyNeural" --text "Or searching through voice notes by topic instead of scrolling through a list of timestamps." --write-media a22.mp3 && echo "✓ a22"
edge-tts --voice "en-US-GuyNeural" --text "What does it actually do?" --write-media a23.mp3 && echo "✓ a23"
edge-tts --voice "en-US-GuyNeural" --text "So in a multi-agent pipeline, the coordinator doesn't waste tokens processing stuff it's already delegated." --write-media a24.mp3 && echo "✓ a24"
